    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d412">

                <pb facs="0438" n="432" xml:id="pg432"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Taylor</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-01"><hi rendition="#italic">January 1,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham instructs Mr. Taylor to again inform the minister for foreign affairs
                    that the United States will agree at “once to conclude a convention for the
                    settlement of unadjusted claims, although the Mora claim, the correspondence
                    relating to which has been called for by Congress, has been adjusted and its
                    payment too long deferred.</p>
            </div>
